! Masks API Tree — Build Plan

OODA-HA plan for creating `packages/lares-core/memes/api/lares/masks/` and populating it with
skeleton meme-loci ready for talk-story-dev fill passes.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/observe>>

!! ✶ Observe

!!! Target tree

```
packages/lares-core/memes/api/lares/masks/
  masks.md                          → lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/masks
  named/
    mischief-muse.md                → lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/masks/named/mischief-muse
    tide-caller.md                  → lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/masks/named/tide-caller
    breach-watch.md                 → lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/masks/named/breach-watch
