!!! Write order

# `masks.md` — parent index (smallest; must exist before children can backlink)
# `named/mischief-muse.md` — first and senior; sets the template for named masks
# `named/tide-caller.md`, `breach-watch.md`, `ink-clerk.md`, `map-wisp.md` — parallel (all follow same pattern)
# `character/ghost-of-mark-twain.md` — most filled; sets character template
# `character/friend-computer.md` — follows character template
# `chorus/lagrange-chorus.md` — different structure; write last

